#. ~ Description of "tempered steel broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An early modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An Early Modern sword that saw use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  "
"This sword appears to be made very poorly, but it should still stand up to a "
"few swings."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of an Early Modern sword that saw use in the "
"16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer "
"rapiers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rapier"
